{#
  The movement-role edit form — the Twig counterpart of
  module/Schoenstatt/view/schoenstatt/roles/edit.phtml and its fields-partial.phtml.

  Two things here differ from the other small forms in this batch:

  - **The partial does not render `submit`.** It stops at `security`, and edit.phtml adds
    `formSubmit($form->get('submit'))` after it. So the submit here is `form_submit`, not
    `form_row` — a different wrapper, and the two produce different markup.
  - **`associationId` and `roleTitle` render with the translator off**, which is the
    partial's `formSelect()->setTranslatorEnabled(false)` around exactly those two rows.
    An association's name and a role's title are data, not interface text: running them
    through the catalogue turns a role called "Member" into whatever the German catalogue
    says for the English word. The rows after them are back to translated options.

  **The field rows live in `schoenstatt/_role-fields.html.twig` now**, shared with the create
  form so that a field cannot be added to one surface and quietly forgotten on the
  other. What stays in this file is what edit.phtml keeps outside its own partial —
  which is not the same set for every entity, and is the detail worth checking before
  moving anything across the boundary.
#}
{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block page_stylesheets %}
        <link href="/css/gen-selectize-jquery-ui.css" media="screen" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
{% endblock %}

{% block page_scripts %}
        <script src="/js/_selectize.min.js"></script>
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<h1>{{ translate(page_title) }}</h1>

{{ form_open(form, form_action) }}
{{ include('schoenstatt/_role-fields.html.twig') }}
{{ form_submit(form.get('submit')) }}
{{ form_close() }}
{% endblock %}

{% block inline_scripts %}
{#
  `maxItems: 1` with `create: true`: a role title is a single free-text value chosen from
  the titles already in use, so a moderator may type a new one but only one.
#}
<script nonce="{{ csp_nonce() }}">
$(function () {
$("select[name='roleTitle']").selectize({
    create: true,
    maxItems: 1,
    sortField: 'text'
});
});
</script>
{% endblock %}
